        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-gastrulation-streak-attractor-audit-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-gastrulation-streak-attractor-audit-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-gastrulation-streak-attractor-audit-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-3> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled Active Viscous Epiblast Stokes Flow, Strain-Rate Myosin Cable Alignment & Lagrangian Primitive Streak Attractor (Saadaoui-Serra-Mahadevan-Weijer Active Nematic Mechanics)" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 5.72e-01 .

