<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Saadaoui et al. (2020), Serra et al. (2023) & Rozbicki et al. (2015) avian gastrulation tensile ring, Polonaise twin-vortex flow & primitive streak attractor — Model fidelity to source: 59/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates an analytic Polonaise streamfunction `psi = V_dip * Y * (1 - r^2/R^2)^2` with conserved zero net circulation (L73-122), but Pass 1 lacks an explicit 2D viscous Stokes PDE solver coupled to dynamic active nematic Myosin-II tensor `Q_{ij}(x, t)` advection-alignment and Lagrangian FTLE ridge extraction." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py L73–L122: Analytic Polonaise streamfunction surrogate requiring coupled 2D Stokes + active nematic Q(x,t) PDE solver <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py#L73-L122>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

